docs/frontend-integration.md

# Issue drafts under review — not repository documentation.
drafts/

# Soroban writes a ledger-state JSON per test run. They regenerate on every
# `cargo test`, and one parameterised test can emit hundreds, so tracking them
# means constant churn for no review value.
test_snapshots/
.vscode